[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=LumeBSD Markets
Name[pt_BR]=Mercados do LumeBSD
Name[pt]=Mercados do LumeBSD
GenericName=Market terminal
GenericName[pt_BR]=Terminal de mercados
Comment=Quotes, charts, company filings, economy, correlations, supply-chain relations, aircraft and ships, with public data
